+Coverage mode expects the live Starnix sancov PC table and counter table to be
+visible inside the Starnix container at the configured paths. The Linux executor
+uses these files instead of Linux KCOV.
+
 ### Running
 
 Lastly, just run the command below to start fuzzing.
